Subject: [PATCH manager v4 2/2] close #4369: ui: add datacenter option for unique VM/CT IDs

Add a 'Suggest unique VMIDs' boolean row to the Datacenter → Options page.
Defaults to off so the behaviour change is strictly opt-in.

--- a/usr/share/pve-manager/js/pvemanagerlib.js
+++ b/usr/share/pve-manager/js/pvemanagerlib.js
